{
  "info": {
    "name": "Kopi Kangenan API",
    "description": "Koleksi lengkap REST API Kopi Kangenan (Laravel 13 + Sanctum).\n\n## Cara pakai\n\n1. Jalankan server:\n   ```\n   cd D:\\laragon\\www\\kopi-kangenan-api\n   php artisan serve --host=127.0.0.1 --port=8000\n   ```\n2. Pastikan variabel koleksi `baseUrl` = `http://127.0.0.1:8000/api`.\n3. Jalankan **Auth → Login (demo)**. Skrip tesnya menyimpan token ke variabel koleksi `token` secara otomatis.\n4. Semua endpoint yang butuh login memakai header `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`.\n\nDokumentasi lengkap: `docs/api.md`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "addressId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "messageId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "productId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "packId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "voucherCode", "value": "KANGENAN10" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (demo)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('ada token', () => pm.expect(body.data.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.data.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"demo@kangenan.com\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Masuk dengan akun demo. Token disimpan otomatis ke variabel `token`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Daftar",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Budi\",\n  \"identifier\": \"budi@contoh.com\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "register"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Google (simulasi)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"pengguna.google@gmail.com\",\n  \"name\": \"Pengguna Google\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login/google", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login", "google"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Saya siapa",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "me"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Keluar",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
